# Un'Goro Crater (53-54): the Horde visit of Un'Goro Crater, with the Thunder Bluff and Ratchet
# quests tied to it, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/ungoro_crater_53_54.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Un'Goro Crater, area 490).
# The guide's quest list is section 19 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md. Crystals of Power
# (4284, the pylons' prerequisite), The Scent of Lar'korwi (4291) and the Marshal's Refuge flight
# path come from Feralas & Un'Goro Crater (49-50).
# Carried in: Delivery to Magatha (3518, from Jediga in Azshara), March of the Silithid (4494, from
# Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar), The Strength of Corruption (4120,
# taken at Camp Mojache, its bears and wolves killed in Felwood) and Seeking Spiritual Aid (5158,
# from Greta Mosshoof in Felwood).
# Left to later guides: Magatha's Payment to Jediga (3562, Azshara), Cleansed Water Returns to
# Felwood (5159), The New Springs (980, Winterspring) and Rabine Saturna (1123, Moonglade).
# Left out: Zapper Fuel (4146) and Bloodpetal Zapper (4148): the Atal'ai Haze drops only inside the
# Temple of Atal'Hakkar dungeon. It's Dangerous to Go Alone (3962): it needs Linken's Adventure
# (3961), the end of Linken's chain done in Winterspring (58-59). Hol'anyee's Big Book of Big Lizards
# (92020): level 55 to take, handed in at the summit of Mount Hyjal, where no guide goes.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar (the auction house); Ratchet; Gadgetzan; down the
# slope into Un'Goro to Torwa Pathfinder, then north along the east side (Lar'korwi, the gorillas) to
# Marshal's Refuge; one big loop (the north and east, Torwa again, the hive, Terror Run, the west,
# Fire Plume Ridge and Ringo back to the refuge); U'cha and A-Me 01 in the gorilla cave; Torwa a last
# time and the hearthstone to Gadgetzan; Camp Mojache, Thunder Bluff, Ratchet and Orgrimmar.

guide Un'Goro Crater (53-54)
faction horde
levels 53 54
carry 3518 3563 3568 3909 4120 4494 5084 5158
leave 980 1123 3562 3563 3568 3909 5084 5159
next Azshara (54-54)

# Orgrimmar -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
note "Fly to Orgrimmar from Bloodvenom Post in Felwood, for its auction house" npc 3310
ah 4244.1 npc 8673
tip A-Me 01, a robot in Un'Goro Crater, needs a Mithril Casing. Nothing in the crater drops it: buy it here, or have an engineer make it.
ah 4496.2 npc 8673
ah 3761.1 npc 8673
tip Un'Goro Soil: 5 for Alchemist Pestlezugg and 20 for Thunder Bluff, so 25 in all. It also comes from the dirt piles all over the crater.
fly "Ratchet, The Barrens" npc 3310

